_model: proposition
---
title: Proposition 76
---
order: 76
---
short_label: X.76
---
statement: If from a straight line there is subtracted a straight line which is incommensurable in square with the whole and which with the whole makes the sum of the squares on them added together rational, but the rectangle contained by them medial, then the remainder is irrational; let it be called <i>minor.</i>
---
proof:

